      <xsd:annotation>
       <xsd:documentation>Represents the filter operation for this filter item. Valid values are: equals notEqual lessThan greaterThan lessOrEqual greaterOrEqual contains notContain startsWith includes excludes within (DISTANCE criteria only)</xsd:documentation>
