       <xsd:documentation>Indicates whether the ITSM Incident Management feature is enabled (true) or disabled (false) for your org. The default value is false. Available in API version 63.0 and later.</xsd:documentation>
       <xsd:appinfo>Type: boolean</xsd:appinfo>
