       <xsd:documentation>Required. The type of date. Valid values are: Date—A legacy date type. Available when the time zone isn’t enabled. DateOnly—A date type without an associated time. Available when the time zone is enabled. DateTime—A date type that contains both date and time parts. Available when the time zone is enabled.</xsd:documentation>
